    "hub": {
      "text": "哦……你来了。我话撂在前头——周氏那边我得给交代。你要问话就问，但最后拿不出真凭实据……我只能按程序报上去。",
      "emotion": "nervous",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "这件事你怎么看？",
          "goto": "intro",
          "type": "ask"
        },
        {
          "text": "那片礁石，本地人都知道？",
          "goto": "ask_reef",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "lizheng_talked_once"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "老范这个人怎么样？",
          "goto": "ask_fan",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "lizheng_talked_once"
            }
          ],
          "min_hub_visits": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "阿贵这两天有什么异常吗？",
          "goto": "ask_agui_spending",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "lizheng_talked_once"
            }
          ],
          "min_hub_visits": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "周德茂你了解吗？",
